	(text "GPIO restrictions (verify fitted DevKitC-1 revision/module): GPIO0 boot strapping; GPIO45/46 strapping; GPIO19/20 USB D-/D+; GPIO35-37 unavailable on octal flash/PSRAM variants; GPIO38/48 RGB LED differs by revision; UART pins may conflict with peripherals."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125 40 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2896e605-5244-474b-a1ea-00b863a38260")
	)
	(text "TFT module exact model not verified. Confirm VCC range, logic voltage, backlight connection, current limiting, and touch-controller requirements before PCB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 40 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "51503535-3d57-450d-a4d1-e95d983fa670")
	)
	(text "Power policy: J2 USB-C is the intended 5V input. D1 blocks reverse current into J2. J9 distributes the same VIN rail; do not inject an independent source into J9. Native DevKit USB and J2 are mutually exclusive unless a verified power mux is added."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55 130 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9e1ba2c2-2bbe-4d7e-9528-18e0e7293bd1")
	)
	(text "J5 pin 1 = GPIO19 sourced from J3 pin 20. J6 omits GPIO19 intentionally to keep both breakout headers 18-pin. GPIO19 is also ESP32-S3 USB D-."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125 48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "04a64767-db39-4dfe-bd10-0d797a1861de")
	)
	(text "J4 pin functions: 1 VCC(3V3), 2 GND, 3 CS(GPIO10), 4 RST(GPIO8), 5 DC(GPIO9), 6 MOSI(GPIO11), 7 CLK(GPIO12), 8 BL(3V3), 9 MISO(GPIO13), 10 TOUCH_CLK(GPIO12), 11 TOUCH_CS(GPIO14), 12 TOUCH_DIN(GPIO11), 13 TOUCH_DOUT(GPIO13), 14 TOUCH_IRQ(GPIO15)."
